{"content_unit_id": "cu-reader-problem", "kind": "thesis", "title": "资源多，为什么餐桌少", "editorial_text": "竹林广泛分布并不自动产生食笋文化。视频真正追问的是：为什么竹笋在中国被加工成一套稳定的味觉与消费习惯，而在很多竹区没有形成同样的链路？", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-core-question", "ku-resource-vs-consumption"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000013", "tr-000017", "tr-000019", "ev-frame-regional-map"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 17520, "end_ms": 30400}], "epistemic_status": "agent_inference", "visual_refs": ["ev-frame-regional-map"], "standalone_level": "standalone", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-edible-threshold", "kind": "argument", "title": "第一道门槛是能不能吃", "editorial_text": "先看品种，再看产区。不是所有竹笋都足够大、足够嫩、足够低苦；即使同一类竹子，产地的气候、地形和土壤也会改变最终风味。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-edible-varieties", "ku-light-bitterness"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000087", "tr-000099", "tr-000106", "tr-000110"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 166120, "end_ms": 204040}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": [], "standalone_level": "standalone", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-preservation", "kind": "procedure", "title": "把苦涩变成可保存", "editorial_text": "中国传统处理并不是等待竹笋天然变好，而是主动介入：腌渍、发酵、煮熟、晒干，先降低苦涩，再把短暂的鲜笋变成可以跨季节食用的笋干和酸笋。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-preservation-fermentation"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000127", "tr-000137", "tr-000138", "tr-000140", "ev-frame-edible-threshold"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 234480, "end_ms": 266000}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": ["ev-frame-edible-threshold"], "standalone_level": "standalone", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-oil-fry", "kind": "procedure", "title": "油炒是风味放大器", "editorial_text": "蒸煮容易让挥发性香气随水流失，油炒则借助高温和油脂减少部分腥苦气，并生成更强的熟香方向。竹笋由此不只是被处理得能吃，而是被处理得更有吸引力。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-oil-frying"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000166", "tr-000170", "tr-000173", "tr-000176", "tr-000183", "ev-frame-stir-fry"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 327560, "end_ms": 364440}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": ["ev-frame-stir-fry"], "standalone_level": "standalone", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-umami", "kind": "argument", "title": "竹笋为什么适合和肉一起炖", "editorial_text": "视频把竹笋与肉的组合解释为两层协同：呈味物质叠加形成更强鲜味，多孔纤维则吸收炖煮过程中释放的脂溶性香气。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-meat-umami"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000184", "tr-000191", "tr-000194", "tr-000195", "tr-000199"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 364440, "end_ms": 398040}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": [], "standalone_level": "needs_intro", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-japan", "kind": "example", "title": "日本案例说明另一种解法", "editorial_text": "日本段落说明，少苦、鲜甜的竹笋也可以通过环境与栽培控制获得：海洋性气候、山地环境和遮光技术共同服务于白笋的细嫩口感。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-japan-case"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000246", "tr-000248", "tr-000253", "tr-000254", "tr-000257", "tr-000262"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 473480, "end_ms": 511480}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": [], "standalone_level": "needs_intro", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-five-hour", "kind": "argument", "title": "鲜笋的时间窗口", "editorial_text": "竹笋离土之后仍在变化。视频用“五小时黄金加工”强调采后时效：越晚处理，糖分、鲜度和脆爽口感越难保住。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-five-hour-window"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000271", "tr-000275", "tr-000277", "tr-000280", "tr-000288", "tr-000290"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 521680, "end_ms": 558280}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": [], "standalone_level": "standalone", "schema_version": "1.0"}
{"content_unit_id": "cu-modern-chain", "kind": "procedure", "title": "现代加工把季节性延伸到全年", "editorial_text": "产地条件只是起点，现代流程还要接住采后时间：过热蒸汽杀青去涩，冰水快速冷却，随后用超低温冷冻尽量保持鲜甜脆爽。", "knowledge_refs": ["ku-modern-processing", "ku-five-hour-window"], "evidence_refs": ["tr-000292", "tr-000307", "tr-000310", "tr-000314", "tr-000317", "tr-000318", "tr-000322", "tr-000325", "ev-frame-wuyi-bamboo-forest", "ev-frame-factory-blanching"], "source_spans": [{"start_ms": 560960, "end_ms": 638800}], "epistemic_status": "video_explicit", "visual_refs": ["ev-frame-wuyi-bamboo-forest", "ev-frame-factory-blanching"], "standalone_level": "needs_intro", "schema_version": "1.0"}
